      "text": "Line 3 PM on the 15th is conveyor maintenance, not usable. Line 2 AM on the 14th and PM on the 13th are protected \u2014 Henrike only.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T08:05:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Tunde Oyelowo",
      "text": "Six rev D alignment sets in lot 7001-D1 cover all four; the C2 sets are for the old geometry and not for these.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T08:12:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Chidi Okafor",
      "text": "The procedure lets two latch cut-ins run back to back in one window.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T08:20:00"
    }
  ],
  "thread_id": "CHAT-1006",
  "title": "DSGN-0006 line 1 outage \u2014 latch cut-ins"
